    "capabilityDescription": "Google Maps places for a search, each with its name, address, phone, website and rating",
    "providerPriceAtomic": "0",
    "usage": "the place search",
    "hint": "Apify Google Maps, your Apify account: Google Maps places for a search, each with its name, address, phone, website and rating. Call request({id: \"0195f3a1-6c4d-7a2b-9e10-5f6a7b8c9d40\", input: {\"query\":\"<what to search for>\",\"limit\":\"<how many places, e.g. 20>\"}}) alone and wait for its result.",
    "specs": [
      {
